'''Pokémon Adventures: The Snorlax Stop''' is the fourth monthly issue of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga to be released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains the chapters ten, eleven, and twelve of the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue}}. The chapters originally released in this book were later compiled into {{PAV|1}}. As a bonus, it contained a sheet of Pokémon stickers which were not included with the collected volume release.

